# No environment variables are required for the current build.
# The enquiry form opens WhatsApp pre-filled with the visitor's details —
# no third-party service or API key needed.
#
# If you later swap the form to use Web3Forms, EmailJS, or Formspree,
# add the relevant key here as VITE_<SERVICE>_KEY and reference it
# from src/components/EnquiryForm.jsx.
